# The Nodes shot: the mesh as a roster.
#
# Longer than the panel on purpose, so the scroll rail is drawn - and a spread of ages, hop
# counts and signal, so the trailing column shows what a staircase says about a node we heard
# ourselves, and the line under each name says how the others reached us instead.
#
# `clock` is what makes this file a screenshot rather than a picture of when it was taken: the
# seeded log and the clock column both come from it, so re-rendering next month produces the
# same bytes and `git status` stays quiet unless the UI actually moved.
scene demo
scale 4
clock 2026-01-12 19:12
config
tab nodes
